-> talk_to_friends

== talk_to_friends ==
Liora: Hey guys! How is everyone?
Rose: Welcome Liora! It's been a bit. Please join us for some tea.
Myrtle: Nice to see you again, Liora.
Natalie: Liora! You came just in time for cakes!
Henry: Natalie's pastry-making magic is second to none. Nice to see you. Or, maybe not as it means you are uncessful with getting to the capital.
Liora: Yeah, the gate is still closed.
Rose: That's quite unfortunate. Seems like I still have the upper hand in terms of magical training.
Liora: Yeah, its cool that you have a private tutor and everything.
Rose: If only you joined me!
Liora: No, I am busy with my mom's errands and stuff. I can practice when I'm in the forest.
Henry: Are you guys going to be attending the Magic Academia in the fall? I got my acceptance letter!
Liora: Congrats!
Rose: That's amazing, Henry. I knew that with your smarts- you would get in just fine.
Natalie: Congrats!!
Myrtle: I also applied and got it.
Rose: As expected as my secretary and right-hand. You are impeccable at the abacus. I must say that the funds for this tea party are always plentiful.
Myrtle: T-thank you.
Liora: I don't plan on going to school- I'm going straight to taking the enterance exam and getting into The Royal Guard!
Rose: As expected. You'll get there first but when I get in I will quickly rise the ranks.
Liora: Like that'll happen!
Natalie: Now, now. Let's keep the rivalry away from the tea table- shall we?
Henry: We're all friends here, yeah? 
Rose: Of course. Just a little friendly rivalry to keep our magic sharp. Shall we have another spare later, Liora?
Liora: I'll take you on any day!
Natalie: How's your sister, Rose?
Rose: Dahlia is doing better but she still has not recovered. I discovered a way to cure her illness, but the tome required is restricted to the Court Magician.
Henry: That's a bummer. So now you have another reason to become the Court Magician, huh?
Rose: Yes. Both to share my beauty to the world and help my dear sister Dahlia.
    + [Sympathize with Dahlia]
        -> sympathize
    + [Assert your dominance about being the Court Magician]
        -> assert_dominance
-> ask_about_gemstone

== sympathize ==
~ player_charisma += 2
Liora: I hope Dahlia feels better soon! She's always super sweet and nice.
Rose: I know. She is the best sister I could've asked for.
-> ask_about_gemstone

== assert_dominance ==
~ player_charisma -= 1
Liora: OI! The one who will be The Court Magician is me!
Rose: We will have a showdown for the title, naturally.
Henry: Alright, break it up...
-> ask_about_gemstone

== ask_about_gemstone ==
Liora: Anyways, have you guys seen a gemstone around here?
Henry: Gemstone? Who has enough money to buy one at this time?
Natalie: Maybe it's a family heirloom of sorts.
Myrtle: I- I think Rose might have. She mentioned something about a shiny object right before you got here.
Rose: Thank you for bringing it up! I saw a shiny gem streak from the sky- it was like it was destined for me!
Rose: It dropped right into my hands but some boy from that blasted Werewolf Gang stole it!
Henry: That's awful!
Liora: Werewolf Gang? Do you mean those three kids I see always running around?
Natalie: You haven't met them? They are orphans who live in the orphanage at the edge of town. But I heard they're a little feral and cause lots of trouble.
Henry: They also apparently steal things. Like the gemstone that Rose mentioned.
Liora: Do you know where they went?
Rose: I am not sure. Maybe you can lure them out with some of that awful smelling slime. They love messing around with trash.
Myrtle: That's a little mean...
Rose: What did you say, Myrtle?
Myrtle: Eek!
Liora: I'll see what I can find.
-> END